            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.cveq.2010.08.002</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Identification and alleviation of visceral pain is a frequent concern for the equine owner and veterinarian. This article discusses sources, methods for identification and quantitation, and options for treatment of visceral pain in horses.</AbstractText>
